@startuml

title RL Supervisor - Networks Module Class Diagram

left to right direction

package "agent.py" as AgentModule <<Python module>> {
    class PPOAgent
}

package "networks.py" as NetworksModule <<Python module>> {
    class Models
    class TrainableStdDev
    class ActionResult <<dataclass>>
    class PolicyOptimizationMetrics <<dataclass>>
    class CriticOptimizationMetrics <<dataclass>>
}

PPOAgent *--> Models
Models *--> TrainableStdDev

@enduml
